@chapter (Pseudo) Randomly generated password
@cindex password

Workspace to generate passwords.

@deffn ∇ password ← length pw∆password character_set

Function returns a pseudo-randomly generated password from the given
character set.  If length is omitted, eight characters will be
generated.

@end deffn

@deffn set ← pw∆alpha

Returns a list of alphabetic characters.

@end deffn

@deffn set ← pw∆numeric

Returns the ten digits in Arabic numerals.

@end deffn

@deffn set ← pw∆dingbats

Returns a set of characters that are not alpha-numeric.  Wikipedia
does not agree with what a dingbat is.  This function can't read
Wikipedia.

It also can't read the instructions you have from some rogue website.
Type them in. viz:

@quotation
pw∆password pw∆alpha,pw∆numeric,'!*%^$'
@end quotation

@end deffn

